{"unit_id":"tag:02KN:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n假设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>也是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>沿<MATH_0005>的基变换（base change）：<MATH_0006>。设<MATH_0007>是概形（schemes）态射（morphisms）的一种性质（property）。于是可以问：（a）<MATH_0008>是否成立，以及反过来的（b）<MATH_0009>是否成立。若每当<MATH_0010>平坦（flat）时（a）都成立，则称<MATH_0011>在平坦（flat）基变换（base change）下保持。若每当<MATH_0012>满射（surjective）且平坦（flat）时（b）都成立，则称<MATH_0013>经平坦（flat）满射（surjective）基变换（base changes）下降（descends）。若<MATH_0014>在平坦（flat）基变换（base changes）下保持，且经平坦（flat）满射（surjective）基变换（base changes）下降（descends），则称<MATH_0015>在目标（target）上是平坦（flat）局部的（local）。可与第<REF_0001>节的讨论比较。这是一个非常重要的概念，我们将在下面的定义中将其形式化。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"descends","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"descends","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射的源与目标；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"用于定义基变换的态射；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"沿目标态射的基变换；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所讨论性质的对象；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质","context":"在基变换下考察的数学性质；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"基变换态射的平坦条件；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"性质下降所要求的满射条件；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换","context":"性质保持与下降所沿的基变换；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"descends","target_term":"下降","context":"从基变换后态射向原态射传递性质；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标","context":"局部性所在的态射目标；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部的","context":"相对于平坦拓扑的局部性；尚待术语批准。"}],"notes":[]}
